  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ribollita starts with a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "soffritto",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "soffritto"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " of onion, carrot, and celery, then builds slowly with beans and greens. It serves 4 and gets better the next day when the bread has fully absorbed the broth."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Dark leafy "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "cavolo nero",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "cavolo-nero"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " gives the soup its distinctive bitterness and body. Stale bread stirred in at the end thickens everything to a porridge-like consistency."
          }
        ]
      },
